** MMP9600 - REPORTING-MODE BLOCK INFERENCE FIXTURE (ISSUE #5)
** No structured-mode terminators anywhere -- reporting mode is detected
** purely from the LOOP tell, since detect_mode checks for structured
** tells first. LOOP's body is consistently more indented than the LOOP
** line itself, so reporting_loop_plan should find this unambiguous and
** infer LOOP as a rule_candidate (confidence='inferred') rather than
** leaving it unrecognised.
FIND (10) MILL-ORDER WITH GRADE-CODE = 'X9'
  LOOP
    DISPLAY ORDER-NO
    ADD 1 TO #COUNT
  DOEND
END
